        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- English Mission & Vision -->
      <div class="lang-block" data-lang="en" dir="ltr">
        <div class="mv-grid">
          <article class="mv-item">
            <h2>Our Vision 🪞</h2>
            <p>To restore harmony as a living, directly experienced reality rather than a detached abstraction—where proportion, resonance, color, space, and human perception reflect one another like a clear mirror (<strong>Royal Harmony 🪞 Golden Reality</strong>).</p>
          </article>
          <article class="mv-item">
            <h2>Our Mission 👁️</h2>
            <p>To build an open, experiential laboratory that invites every visitor to perceive, hear, and test balance firsthand—uniting qualitative intuition, harmonic acoustics, visual alignment, and physical/virtual fabrication readiness into one coherent studio accessible to thinkers, designers, engineers, and curious minds everywhere.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- French Mission & Vision -->
      <div class="lang-block" data-lang="fr" dir="ltr">
        <div class="mv-grid">
          <article class="mv-item">
            <h2>Notre Vision 🪞</h2>
            <p>Redonner à l’harmonie sa place de réalité vivante et directement éprouvée plutôt que d’abstraction isolée — où la proportion, la résonance, la couleur, l’espace et la perception humaine se reflètent comme dans un miroir limpide (<em>Harmonie Royale 🪞 Réalité Dorée</em>).</p>
          </article>
